direct contact with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!

#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are an immutable selfishness;
projected personalities that cannot change, even
if they know being as they are hurts others.

With my body freed from #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's gravity――
from the force field of her mind,
